n. :)','2024-08-04 19:32:09',0,1,0,0),(21,3,'marsoc',4,'hello','hello\\r\\n','2024-08-04 23:31:44',0,0,0,0),(22,26,'amariiswordmaster',23,'hai','hello fren!','2024-08-05 00:09:47',0,0,0,0),(23,23,'bpike34',26,'ello','whats up :D','2024-08-05 01:19:42',0,0,0,0),(24,2,'george0001',3,'play solo','hi, thanks for informing me!','2024-08-05 06:50:16',0,0,0,0),(25,3,'marsoc',26,'RE: hai','hi','2024-08-05 16:01:14',0,0,0,0),(26,26,'amariiswordmaster',3,'hai','ola fren. when u come online can u host a boomblox server?\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n- Amarii 8/5/24','2024-08-05 16:01:26',0,0,0,0),(27,27,'1o4xy9i8h9fPwnerv1',26,'Plz give me admin (jk)','Hey fren, we\\\'ll play orrh later','2024-08-05 16:06:36',0,0,0,0),(28,26,'amariiswordmaster',3,'hai','tank you for opening ma fav website !!! me is js so happy!!!!!!1!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nAmarii - 8/5/24','2024-08-05 23:54:00',0,0,0,0),(29,26,'amariiswordmaster',1,'hai','boomblox on top','2024-08-05 23:54:48',1,0,0,0),(30,26,'amariiswordmaster',2,'me parrite','can my avatar be on the banner for hallowween?\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nAmarii - 8/5/24\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nthis is history :3','2024-08-05 23:57:16',0,1,0,0),(31,27,'1o4xy9i8h9fPwnerv1',26,'Read this now','01101000 01110100 01110100 01110000 01110011 00111010 00101111 00101111 01110111 01110111 01110111 00101110 01111001 01101111 01110101 01110100 01110101 01100010 01100101 00101110 01100011 01101111 01101101 00101111 01110111 01100001 01110100 01100011 01101000 00111111 01110110 00111101 01011111 01101011 01001101 01000101 00110110 01001010 01001000 00101101 01100101 01100001 01110111','2024-08-05 23:57:23',0,0,0,0),(32,3,'marsoc',2,'update','you can now buy boomblox visor and onsale items\\r\\noffsale items now actually appear as offsale and cannot be bought','2024-08-06 00:38:14',0,1,0,0),(33,2,'george0001',26,'halloween banner','i had seen that you asked me via the boomblox messages that you want to be in the hallowe